<title>JAPAN: Sanwa Shutter to issue 50 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Shutter to issue 50 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Sanwa Shutter Corp</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - Sakura Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	    ISSUE NO   2    AMT   50 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.9% (tentatively) ISSU PRICE PAR  MATURITY 31.Mar.06</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Nov.96   CONV TO 30.Mar.06</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 7.Oct.96   INT PAY end-Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 30 Sep-4 Oct</p>
<p> LAST JCR A+	    LAST JBRI A	   LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be set on September 27.</p>
</text>
